    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a bit too general for what i need. my stakeholders want more specific direction so they can start budgeting for localized assets. \n\nfor example, for someone like Yuki Tanaka, should we be looking at more minimalistic, zen-like layouts? and for Chidi Okoro, maybe something more vibrant or bold with different color palettes? i'm trying to figure out if we should be leaning into specific \"cultural aesthetics\" for these groups to make the app feel more premium to them specifically, rather than just a one-size-fits-all western design.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
